    "Scan of the 1981 edition of the Sugar Hill, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1975; aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1978; last revised in 1981; printed in 1982.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 24.1 x 29 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
